          <h1 id="privacy-title">Privacy Policy — Our Commitment to Your Privacy</h1>
          <p class="lead">JOOD collects and processes personal data to operate our services and provide the best possible customer experience. This document explains what we collect, why we process it, how we protect it, and the controls available to you. <strong>Effective date: 1 January 2026</strong>.</p>
          <p class="note">This policy applies to JOOD FZ-LLC and its controlled affiliates (collectively, “JOOD”, “we”, “our”, or “us”).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
